# templates/MANIFEST: which template paths a cluster gets. One rule per line: `<path or dir/> <condition>`.
# A path not listed is always rendered. The most specific (longest) matching rule wins. Conditions use the resolved
# values (hack/apronlib.py evaluate): dotted keys, not/and/or, == / != against 'quoted' strings.
# Lines inside a file can be switched too, with `#@if <condition>` ... `#@end` (no nesting).

